Vertical chain (code path in intelligence/store.go IngestObservation):
  Observation append → publish observation.created
  Source upsert → publish source.fetched
  Evidence pending → publish evidence.sealed
  RegionEngine.MatchPoint
  classifyDomain/Severity + TrustTier → Event (dedup titlesAreSimilar+haversine)
  Assessment Status=unverified → publish assessment.updated
  ScoringEngine.ComputeRiskScore multi-dim → publish risk.changed
  Alert if delta/threshold → publish alert.created + AuditEvent
  Audit observation.ingested + save

Wiring (app.go):
  SharedIntelStore = intelligence.NewStore(...)
  osintEngine.SetRefreshHook → Observation from OSINTEvent → IngestObservation
  bridge ProposeEvent to root for compat; handlers prefer SharedIntelStore

